      "desc_zh": "抵达上海：\n浦东国际机场—酒店\n出租车：约35分钟；\n磁浮列车：仅8分钟；\n机场三线、机场六线：约40分钟；\n地铁：乘2号线至龙阳路站下，乘7号线至花木站下；约40分钟。\n\n虹桥机场—酒店\n出租车：约35分钟；\n地铁：乘2号线至龙阳路站下，或乘7号线至花木站下再步行至酒店；约50分钟。\n\n上海火车站—酒店\n出租车：相距16公里",
      "desc_en": "Underground\n\nLINE 2 to Longyang Station\n\nLINE 7 to Huamu Station\n\nMAGLEV TRAN to Longyang Station\n\n\n\nTaxi\n\nAbout 35Mins from Pudong International Airport to Pudong Kerry Hotel\n\nAbout 35Mins from Hong International Airport to Pudong Kerry Hotel\n\nAbout 35Mins from Shanghai Railway Station to Pudong Kerry Hotel\n\nAbout 45Mins from Shanghainan Railway Station to Pudong Kerry Hotel\n\nAbout 50Mins from Shanghain Hongqiao Railway Station to Pudong Kerry Hotel",
      "addr_zh": "地址：上海浦东嘉里大酒店",
      "addr_en": "Address：No.1388 Huamu Road,Pudong District,Shanghai.",
      "contact_zh": "电话：400 118 1585",
      "contact_en": "TEL：400 118 1585",
